1205	            // removal or already removed. It is possible that another thread (either partially or
1206	            // completely) removed the new node while we were building the tower, and just after
1207	            // that we installed the new node at one of the higher levels. In order to undo that
1208	            // installation, we must repeat the search, which will unlink the new node at that
1209	            // level.
